OVERVIEW: List all feature flags.

USAGE: grantiva console flags list [--json] [--verbose] [--quiet] [--app <app>] [--env <env>]

OPTIONS:
  --json                  Output as JSON
  --verbose               Print diagnostic detail (timestamps, labels,
                          metadata) to stderr.
  --quiet                 Silence progress diagnostics on stderr; warnings and
                          errors still print. Program output on stdout is
                          unaffected.
  --app <app>             Only show flags scoped to this app ID.
  --env <env>             Show default values for this environment.
  --version               Show the version.
  -h, --help              Show help information.

